## Marker @VERSION@

### Downloads

- **RPM (Fedora)** — `marker-@VERSION@-1.fc*.x86_64.rpm`

  ```sh
  sudo dnf install ./marker-@VERSION@-1.*.rpm
  ```

- **DEB (Debian / Ubuntu)** — `marker_@VERSION@-1_amd64.deb`

  ```sh
  sudo apt install ./marker_@VERSION@-1_amd64.deb
  ```

- **Flatpak bundle** — `com.github.thenathattify.marker.flatpak`

  ```sh
  flatpak install ./com.github.thenathattify.marker.flatpak
  ```

- **Source tarball** — `marker-@VERSION@.tar.gz`

SHA256 checksums of all files above: `SHA256SUMS.txt`.

### Flatpak repository (updated on every release, GPG-signed)

```sh
flatpak remote-add --if-not-exists --from marker https://thenathattify.github.io/Marker/marker.flatpakrepo
flatpak install marker com.github.thenathattify.marker
```

### COPR (Fedora, built automatically by Packit on every release)

```sh
sudo dnf copr enable thenathattify/marker
sudo dnf install marker
```

### PPA (Ubuntu, built automatically by Launchpad on every push to main)

```sh
sudo add-apt-repository ppa:thenathattify/marker
sudo apt update && sudo apt install marker
```
